{"sourceUrl":"https://cie.nufe.edu.cn/info/1008/7136.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:12.672981+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cie.nufe.edu.cn/info/1008/7136.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为推进研究生多元招生，加强拔尖创新人才选拔、提高研究生生源质量，根据教育部有关规定以及《南京财经大学</span><span>2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生工作办法》等文件精神，2026年我院拟接收推荐免试硕士研究生，欢迎各校优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>1.计算机与人工智</span></strong></span><span><strong><span>能学院接收推免生</span></strong><strong><span>的</span></strong><strong><span>专业</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>计算机与人工智能学院</span></span><span><span>所有研究生招生学科、专业（专业学位类别、领域）均可接收推免生，具体包括：</span></span><span><span>0812计算机科学与技术</span></span><span><span>（学硕）、</span></span><span><span>0835软件工程</span></span><span><span>（学硕）、</span></span><span><span>085410人工智能</span></span><span><span>（专硕）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><strong><span></span></strong></span><span><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span>.申请条件和申请程序</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>请参看学校研究生院网站通知：南京财经大学关于接收</span><span>2026年推免生预报名工作的通知</span></span><a href=\"https://yjsc.nufe.edu.cn/info/1011/6661.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjsc.nufe.edu.cn/info/1011/6661.htm</span></span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span>.支持政策</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学校和学院建立丰富完善的奖助体系，我院推免生读期间可按学校和学院有关规定申请学业奖学金、国家奖学金、研究生助学金、社会捐赠类奖（助）学金等。具体奖助标准及评定办法根据上级教育主管部门和学校相关文件执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>窗体顶端</span><span><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>将根据教育部</span></span><span><span>和学校</span></span><span><span>最新推免生政策，及时公布接收推免生相关工作最新信息，请及时关注</span></span><span><span>南京财经大学</span></span><span><span>研究生院网站</span></span><span><span>和我院网站</span></span><span><span>相关信息。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span>5</span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>学校研究生院研究生招生联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学校研究生院研究生招生管理办公室</span><span>E-Mail：yzb@nufe.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学校研究生院咨询电话：</span><span>025-86718661</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>计算机与人工智能学院</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>研究生招生联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>计算机与人工智能学院</span></span><span><span>研究生招生咨询电话：</span><span>025-8671</span></span><span><span>8447</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>倪</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>欢迎报考南京财经大学</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>计算机与人工智能学院</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"cd3aa5d1e1f03e1d573b657ca36b4aa6ec19801192885ef7c3e381e30fcc5210","textLength":666,"sourceSha256":"5b2f98d8b438120a2a9d5ffaf13d3b6d7a1418349c0380cb7ad701fc594c21c6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-615fe707f4e535996809","title":"2025年南京财经大学计算机与人工智能学院关于接收2026年推免生预报名工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:12.672981+00:00"}
